thal-mutation#post1221127\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">on the other they know a firsting probaly shortened their childs life expectancy.<br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really. I mean yes there are garou who die young but the majority end up dying in their 60s/70s which isn't a signficant shortening and that's more from slowing down rather than dropping over.. there's npcs who live 150+ years out there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-22T16:22:28-07:00","id":1221295,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lachdanan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1221127-how-do-kinfolk-parents-regard-the-lethal-mutation?p=1221248#post1221248\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I *think* we can't generalise. Kinfolks move on a wide range. They can be Gaia-fanatics who'd support the Garou with everythink even with their lives to envyous sickos who'd skin their children to gain their power.<br /> <br /> If you'd have some specifics (I suppose you ask for a story's sake) I'd make some recommendations.<br /> <br /> And don't forget to take the Tribe into account. It can tremendiously affect the Kin's worldview.</div> </div> </div> </div>would agree kin can vary a lot.<br /> <br /> How can tribe affect things, as grim and sinister as Shadowlords can be, their kin seem to be as loyal to gaia on average as any.<br /> <br /> idea's how the septcan react to a kin who thinks their son or daughter is demon possessed cursed, or some such BS?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 05-22-2018, 07:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-22T16:58:06-07:00","id":1221306,"title":"","content":"Knowing kin begin grim resignation. Unknowing kin react per their upbringing and personality, tinged with a slight but of Delirium if they're of remarkably low Willpower.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist",